  "description": "** Parking included **\n\nBright and spacious two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment on the sixth floor of the highly regarded Pines development, with superb views overlooking Herbert Park.\n\nThe apartment features a generous open-plan living/dining area, fully equipped modern kitchen and private balcony facing Herbert Park. Designated parking is also available within the secure gated car park.\n\nThe development benefits from multiple entrance areas, three lifts, a dedicated post area and a large car park. Set alongside the beautiful 32-acre Herbert Park, the apartment’s private balcony enjoys a peaceful outlook over mature trees and expansive green spaces.\n\nIdeally located in the heart of Ballsbridge, with Herbert Park on the doorstep and Dublin City Centre within walking distance. Lansdowne Road DART Station, the Aviva Stadium, RDS Showgrounds, Avoca and an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants and local amenities are all nearby.\n\nA fantastic opportunity to enjoy spacious, convenient living in one of Dublin’s most sought-after locations.\n\nFlexible lease terms available between 6 - 12 months.\n\nViewing highly recommended.",
